WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
In America, we've taken bold action

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.200
to swiftly shut down uncontrolled migration.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:07.600
Once we started detaining and deporting everyone

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:09.360
who crossed the border

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:12.000
and removing illegal aliens from the United States,

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:13.320
they simply stopped coming.

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:14.240
They're not coming anymore.

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:16.120
We're getting a lot of credit, but they're not coming anymore.

